      "Are customers more likely to leave a review if the product was a positive experience versus a negative experience?\n",
      "      \n",
      "Yes !\n",
      "\n",
      "Evidence from the scatterplots:\n",
      "\n",
      "Most ratings fall between 4★ and 5★.\n",
