      "the high-rating range. This means most reviews being left are positive.\n",
      "\n",
      "Low ratings (1★–2★) have very few reviews.\n",
      "Products with negative ratings tend to have very low review counts, indicating fewer people bother to \n",
      "review when they are dissatisfied.\n",
      "\n",
      "High-review products almost always have high ratings.\n",
      "Products with 100+ or even 500+ reviews are almost always rated above 4★.\n",
      "Negative-rated products almost never accumulate large numbers of reviews.\n",
      "\n",
      "This pattern is consistent across all product categories (desktop, laptop, phone). \n"
     ]
